{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近\n展覧会とかの良さがわかるようになりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ更新の無かった日を振り返りますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日にね\nママの誕生日プレゼントに\nご飯行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/07/1697995/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママの誕生日は1か月以上前なんだけど\nツアーがあって中々 行けなかったから\nやっと行けたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/07/1697995/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/07/1697995/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後はなんとなく\n近くでやってた『動きのカガク展』へ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい\nやっと冒頭のお話ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、ちょくちょく展覧会とか行くのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学生の頃とか\n夏休みの宿題で行ってたけど\n最近はほとんど行ってなかったんだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今も\n時間あるときに近くでやってる展覧会があったら見にいくってくらいで\n「何かのついで」みたいな形だけど\nすごい自分のためになる感じがする＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は一人で仕事終わりに\n『JAGDA学生グランプリ2015』\nを見てきました(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同世代の方々の作品ってこともあって\nすごいな～とも思ったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純粋に見てて面白かったなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとつひとつ\nじっくり見てしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/07/1697995/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと積極的に行こー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！二科展！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近くだったから\n今日見に行けば良かったなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/07/1697995/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月おめぺろ(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブレポとかメンテナンスとかと重なって\n告知遅くなりました(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイプラさんに\nまた載せていただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう中田レギュラーですかね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/07/1697995/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひひひ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://idol-planet.com/premium/201508/28-nogizaka46-7"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んで～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}